          "docs": "Create a new schemaExtension definition and its associated schema extension property to extend a supporting resource type. Schema extensions let you add strongly-typed custom data to a resource. The app that creates a schema extension is the owner app. Depending on the \r\nstate of the extension, the owner app, and only the owner app, may update or delete the extension.  See examples of how to define a schema extension that describes a training course, \r\nuse the schema extension definition to crea"
