          },
          "docs": "Update properties in the definition of the specified schemaExtension. Additive updates to the extension can only be made when the extension is in the InDevelopment or Available status. This means custom properties or target resource types cannot be removed from the definition, but new custom properties can be added and the description of the extension changed. The update applies to all the resources that are included in the targetTypes property of the extension. These resources are among the sup"
