          "docs": "Delete the definition of a schema extension. Only the app that created the schema extension (owner app) can delete the schema extension definition, and only when the extension is in the InDevelopment state. Deleting a schema extension definition does not affect accessing custom data that has been added to resource instances based on that definition."
